  - id: the_locust_swarm
    displayName: The Locust Swarm
    flavorText: An unstoppable locust army strips the land bare, wave after wave
      of palmerworm, locust, cankerworm, and caterpiller devouring what the last
      left, as the terrible day of the LORD draws near.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: To shock a complacent Judah into repentance by describing a devastating,
      unprecedented locust invasion, pictured throughout as an unstoppable invading
      army, and to identify this catastrophe as the day of the LORD, a day of darkness
      and judgment worse than anything the elders had seen in their lifetimes.
    deliveredByManagerId: joel
    managerId: locust_plague_day_of_the_lord
