  - id: rend_your_heart
    displayName: Rend Your Heart
    flavorText: Calls Judah to rend their hearts and not their garments, summoning
      priests, elders, and even the bride and bridegroom to a solemn fast before
      a LORD who is gracious and merciful and slow to anger.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: To summon Judah to genuine inward repentance, fasting, weeping, and
      mourning from the heart, rather than mere outward ritual, grounded in an appeal
      to God's own character as gracious and merciful, slow to anger, and of great
      kindness.
    deliveredByManagerId: joel
    managerId: call_to_repentance
