  - id: renewed_years
    displayName: Renewed Years
    flavorText: Promises to restore the years the locusts devoured, filling the threshing
      floors with wheat and the vats with wine and oil so Israel is satisfied and
      never ashamed again.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: To promise renewed material abundance, corn, wine, and oil, and the
      removal of reproach among the nations, and to reassure Israel of God's continuing
      presence once genuine repentance has been made.
    deliveredByManagerId: 
    managerId: restoration_of_the_years
