  - id: poured_out_spirit
    displayName: Poured-Out Spirit
    flavorText: Pours out the Spirit upon all flesh so that sons and daughters prophesy,
      old men dream dreams, and young men see visions, before the sun turns to darkness
      and the moon to blood.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: To promise a future, universal outpouring of God's Spirit upon all flesh,
      producing prophecy, dreams, and visions across every class and both sexes,
      accompanied by cosmic signs, with deliverance promised to whosoever shall call
      on the name of the LORD.
    deliveredByManagerId: 
    managerId: outpouring_of_the_spirit
